[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0228","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3649","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird 跨源信息泄露漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 7.0 及 Thunderbird 7.0 在 Windows 平台使用 Direct2D（D2D）API 配合 Azure 图形后端时，存在同源策略绕过漏洞。该漏洞是 CVE-2011-2986 的回归问题，远程攻击者可通过将跨域图像数据插入 canvas 元素，窃取其他域中的敏感图像信息，导致信息泄露。攻击复杂度较高，需目标系统启用 Direct2D 和 Azure 图形后端。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3649"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-09T11:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:41Z","remediation":"升级至 Firefox 8.0 或 Thunderbird 8.0 及以上版本。对于 Windows 系统，可在 about:config 中将 gfx.content.azure.enabled 设为 false 以禁用 Azure 图形后端作为临时缓解措施，或在 Firefox 选项中取消勾选\"启用硬件加速\"以禁用 Direct2D 渲染。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00020.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-50.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50591","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=655836","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14025","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3649.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3649","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3649.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3649","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3649","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3649","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3649.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8b136ad0f9c6a3aaf75bfb273a0e3f34c40c3fb/2011/CVE-2011-3649.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3649.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-3649"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0228.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0227","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3648","title":"Mozilla Firefox 和 Thunderbird Shift JIS 编码跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 和 Thunderbird 在处理 Shift-JIS 编码时存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于对编码中特定无效序列的处理不当，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 Shift-JIS 编码文本，诱使用户访问恶意页面，从而在用户浏览器中注入并执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本。该漏洞影响 Firefox 3.6.24 之前版本及 4.x 至 7.0 版本、Thunderbird 3.1.6 之前版本及 5.0 至 7.0 版本，攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意构造的链接或页面，利用条件较为有限，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3648"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-11-09T11:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:41Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 3.6.24 或 8.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.16 或 8.0 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.5 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用层对用户输入进行 Shift_JIS 编码校验，过滤非法的多字节序列，并设置 Content-Type 为 UTF-8 以降低 XSS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-11/msg00020.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-47.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1439.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=690225","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14212","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2011/CVE-2011-3648.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3648.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-3648.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-3648.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3648","https://github.com/elizaOS/eliza/blob/9bdcf068bd88d39c82927a861df810d0c7810da1/packages/os/linux/tails/wiki/src/news/version_0.9.mdwn","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3648","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3648","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3648.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-3648"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0227.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0099","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3402","title":"Microsoft Windows TrueType 字体解析引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 内核模式驱动 win32k.sys 中的 TrueType 字体解析引擎存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含特制字体数据的 Word 文档或访问恶意网页触发该漏洞，导致系统内核层面远程代码执行。该漏洞已被 Duqu 蠕虫在 2011 年 11 月利用于真实攻击，影响 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2/R2/R2 SP1 及 Windows 7 Gold/SP1 等多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3402"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-11-04T21:55:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:14Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS11-087 对应的更新 KB2639417。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新，或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。受影响系统包括 Windows XP SP2/SP3、Windows Server 2003 SP2、Windows Vista SP2、Windows Server 2008 SP2/R2/R2 SP1、Windows 7 Gold/SP1。如无法立即打补丁，可在管理员命令行下执行 `icacls \"%windir%\\system32\\t2embed.dll\" /deny *S-1-1-0:(F)` 拒绝访问 T2EMBED.DLL 作为临时缓解措施，注意此操作会影响依赖嵌入字体的应用程序（如 PDF 生成）。安装更新后需撤销该缓解措施以恢复功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.mcafee.com/mcafee-labs/the-day-of-the-golden-jackal-%E2%80%93-further-tales-of-the-stuxnet-files","http://blogs.technet.com/b/msrc/archive/2011/11/03/microsoft-releases-security-advisory-2639658.aspx","http://isc.sans.edu/diary/Duqu+Mitigation/11950","http://secunia.com/advisories/49121","http://secunia.com/advisories/49122","http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2639658","http://www.securelist.com/en/blog/208193197/The_Mystery_of_Duqu_Part_Two","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027039","http://www.symantec.com/connect/w32-duqu_status-updates_installer-zero-day-exploit","http://www.symantec.com/content/en/us/enterprise/media/security_response/whitepapers/w32_duqu_the_precursor_to_the_next_stuxnet.pdf","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-347A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-129A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-164A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/control_systems/pdf/ICS-ALERT-11-291-01E.pdf","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2011/ms11-087","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-034","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-039","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13998","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15290","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15645","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-3402","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-3402.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3402.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-3402/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3402.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2023/CVE-2023-26369.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2011-3402.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-3402.html","https://github.com/rapid7/nexpose-client/blob/9ef9c0f27b1de0663753bd1613afe803b6f30d86/lib/nexpose/vuln.rb","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_cve_extracter.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0009","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3171","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9152,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10838}}","description":"Pure-FTPd 1.0.22 及可能其他版本在 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 及其他启用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能的操作系统上存在目录遍历漏洞。当启用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能时，本地攻击者可通过未知攻击向量利用路径遍历漏洞覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞源于对文件路径验证不充分，攻击者需具备本地访问权限且目标系统需启用 OES 远程功能才能利用，CVSS 评分 3.6，属低危漏洞，影响 Pure-FTPd 1.0.22 及可能受影响的其他版本。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3171"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-11-04T21:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:47Z","remediation":"升级 Pure-FTPd 至 1.0.32 或更高版本（SUSE 用户通过 `zypper update pure-ftpd` 安装官方补丁）。若无法立即升级，请在 pure-ftpd 配置中禁用 Netware OES 远程服务器功能（移除或注释 `OES` 相关配置项并重启服务），并限制仅有可信用户具备本地登录权限，以缓解任意文件覆盖风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00015.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49541","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69686","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-3171.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x50000/49541/info.html","https://github.com/vito1317/ai-weakness-scan/blob/530cc6a27c6af8957110e6c1f64edc534d36af1b/data/cvelistV5_raw/extracted/cvelistV5-main/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3171.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3171","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dirtra.txt","https://github.com/8yumzy88/nuclei-templates/blob/f0baec1d529f779bea6b459424ce11daf8c83f27/network/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3171.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0010","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3315","title":"Cisco Unified Communications Manager 及 Unified Contact Center Express 目录遍历漏洞","description":"多个 Cisco 统一通信产品存在目录遍历漏洞（CVE-2011-3315，CNVD-2011-4503），影响 Cisco Unified Communications Manager (CUCM) 5.x、6.x（6.1(5)SU2 前）、7.x（7.1(5b)SU2 前）、8.x（8.0(3) 前），以及 Cisco Unified Contact Center Express (UCCX) 与 Unified IP IVR 多个版本（6.0(1)SR1ES8 前、7.0(x)（7.0(2)ES1 前）、8.0(x) 至 8.0(2)SU3、8.5(x)（8.5(1)SU2 前））。攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 `../`）的恶意 URL 请求，利用 `file` 参数处理缺陷，未经身份认证即可遍历目录读取服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、日志、敏感凭证等），CVSS 评分 7.8（高危），CWE-22 目录遍历。攻击条件为攻击者可网络访问目标 Web 管理接口，无需认证。利用方式为发送包含 `../` 序列的 HTTP 请求读取敏感文件。Cisco 已发布补丁修复（CSCth09343、CSCts44049）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3315"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-10-27T21:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:04Z","remediation":"建议将 Cisco Unified Communications Manager (CUCM) 升级至 6.1(5)SU2、7.1(5b)SU2 或 8.0(3) 及以上版本；将 Cisco Unified Contact Center Express (UCCX) 与 Unified IP-IVR 升级至 6.0(1)SR1ES8、7.0(2)ES1、8.0(2)SU3 或 8.5(1)SU2 及以上版本。如暂时无法升级，应在边界防火墙或反向代理上限制对 CUCM/UCCX Web 管理接口的源 IP 访问并禁用不必要的 HTTP 目录访问，以缓解任意文件读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20111026-cucm","http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20111026-uccx","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36256","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2011/CVE-2011-3315.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-3315.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2011-3315.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3315.json","https://