: URL，远程攻击者可通过诱使用户访问特制网页，利用该漏洞绕过同源策略限制，跨源读取目标网站的 Cookie 信息，导致用户敏感数据泄露。攻击无需认证，仅需用户浏览恶意页面即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3887"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-10-25T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:06Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 15.0.874.102 或更高版本，该版本修复了 javascript: URL 处理不当导致的 Cookie 跨源读取问题。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 或使用 NoScript 等扩展限制不可信来源的脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=98407","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/10/chrome-stable-release.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70965","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13179","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3887.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3887","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-3887.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3887.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3887","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3887.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-3887","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b258f1790af19a85ccc98f5e771360cd7a4cb4d7/2011/CVE-2011-3887.j