yInPrototypeChain函数与__proto__属性的处理、HTMLPlugInImageElement::allowedToLoadFrameURL函数与javascript:URL的使用、XSLTProcessor::createDocumentFromSource函数对XSLT生成文档的源判定错误、以及ScriptController::executeIfJavaScriptURL函数对同步框架加载的不当处理。攻击者无需用户认证即可实施跨站脚本攻击，窃取敏感信息或执行恶意操作。该漏洞影响Chrome和Android两大平台，危害范围广泛。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3881"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-10-25T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:34:05Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 15.0.874.102 或更高版本；升级 Apple Safari 至 5.1.4 或更高版本；升级 Android 至 4.4 或更高版本。如无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 或使用内容安全策略（CSP）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=96047","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=96885","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=98053","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=99512","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=99750","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/10/chrome-stable-release.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.rafayhackingarticles.net/2014/10/a-tale-of-another-sop-bypass-in-android.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/webkit/+/109d59bf6fe4abfd001fc60ddd403f1046b117ef","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70959","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12940","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2011/CVE-2011-3881.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-3881.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3881.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-3881.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3881","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e9e7730d92360d278d7b57d736f4a4606c1ac1a4/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-3881.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3881.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-3881.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-3881","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2011/CVE-2011-3881.md","https://github.com/AnugiArrawwala/CVE-Research"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0237.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0145","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2845","title":"Apple WebKit 输入验证漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 6.0 之前版本及 Google Chrome 15.0.874.102 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 引擎存在输入验证缺陷（CWE-20）。该漏洞源于 WebKit 对历史记录数据处理不当及对 TIFF/PNG/JPEG 图像格式解析时的内存错误，攻击者可构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发地址栏欺骗或内存损坏，进而导致任意代码执行。漏洞影响范围覆盖 iPhone/iPad (iOS <6.0)、Android 浏览器及桌面端 Chrome/Safari 等所有基于受影响 WebKit 版本的客户端。攻击条件为用户需主动访问恶意页面（用户交互），CVSS 评分 4.3 (AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N)，属中危级别。Apple 已在 iOS 6.0 中修复，Google 已在 Chrome 15.0.874.102 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2845"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-10-25T19:55:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Apple iOS 至 6.0 或更高版本（通过设置 > 通用 > 软件更新在线升级，或连接 iTunes 进行完整恢复升级）。若设备不支持升级至 iOS 6.0，建议停用 Safari 浏览器并改用第三方浏览器（如 Chrome for iOS），同时避免访问不明来源的网页链接。对于桌面端 Chrome 用户，请立即升级至 15.0.874.102 或更高版本（通过 Chrome 菜单 > 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新）。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截可疑的 History API 调用，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=86758","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/10/chrome-stable-release.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13044","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2845","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/osv/cve/2011/UBUNTU-CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2845","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1b057d3bcc2a1da38f6284c6c5f111734c51b6e6/2011/CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2845","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2845.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2011/CVE-2011-2845.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0100","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3544","title":"Oracle Java SE JDK及JRE Scripting组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 的 Java Runtime Environment 组件中的 Scripting 子组件存在未指定漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，触发 Java Web Start 应用程序或 Java Applet 调用 Rhino 脚本引擎，在未经沙箱授权的情况下执行任意代码，导致目标系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。该漏洞影响 Oracle Java SE JDK 和 JRE 7 及 6 Update 27 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle 已在 2011 年 10 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3544"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2011-10-19T21:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:27Z","remediation":"立即升级 Java SE 至 JDK/JRE 6 Update 29 及以上版本，或 JDK/JRE 7 Update 1 及以上版本。从 Oracle Java Archive 下载对应平台的最新更新包进行安装。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 支持（控制面板 → Java → 安全 → 取消勾选\"启用 Java 内容\"），并卸载不需要的 Java 运行时环境以减小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-01/msg00049.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=132750579901589&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254866602253&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134254957702612&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-1455.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","http://www.ibm.com/developerworks/java/jdk/alerts/","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/javacpuoct2011-443431.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1384.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50218","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026215","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1263-1","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70849","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13947","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2011-3544","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/18171","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2011/CVE-2011-3544.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/3f571ea8ff2a06e146f8c15c646a3bbc468b1d9e/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2011-3544.yara","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3544.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2011-3544/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2011-3544_AV.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3544","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2011/CVE-2011-3544/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/killvxk/thg-framework/blob/fab929cd77c91373ebc4212bd4e5891b54f0fb1b/data/source/exploits/CVE-2011-3544/Exploit.java","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/17217.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2011-3544.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0217","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3426","title":"Apple iOS Safari 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5 之前版本中的 Safari 浏览器存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于对 HTTP \"Content-Disposition: attachment\" 头处理不当。远程攻击者可通过构造带有该响应头的恶意文件，诱使用户访问包含该文件的网页，从而在用户浏览器中注入并执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 脚本，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意服务器提供的文件，攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3426"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-10-14T10:55:10Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:33:16Z","remediation":"升级至 Apple iOS 5 或更高版本（iOS 5 于 2011 年 10 月发布，修复了 Safari 对 Content-Disposition: attachment 标头处理不当导致的 XSS 漏洞）。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器端对用户上传文件强制设置 Content-Disposition: inline 并过滤 Content-Type 响应头中的危险字符，同时启用 X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff 缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN41657660/index.html","http://jvndb.jvn.jp/jvndb/JVNDB-2011-000088","http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011//Oct/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://osvdb.org/76334","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Jul/158","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4999","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70558","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3426","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/963f7056505b7264e8baa3ce879232850f792056/2011/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-34xx/CVE-2011-3426.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2011-3426.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3426.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0217.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0215","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-3246","title":"Apple iOS CFNetwork URL解析信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple iOS 5.0.1 之前版本及 Mac OS X 10.7.2 之前版本的 CFNetwork 组件存在 URL 解析漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标用户发送特制的 HTTP 或 HTTPS 链接，可诱使用户访问非预期的恶意网站，并导致本应发送给合法网站的 Cookie 被错误传输至攻击者控制的网站，造成用户敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，影响范围包括 iPhone、iPad、iPod touch 等 iOS 设备及 Mac OS X 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-3246"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-10-14T10:55:09Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:57Z","remediation":"将 Apple iOS 升级至 5.0.1 或更高版本，将 Mac OS X 10.7 升级至 10.7.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在受影响的 iOS 设备上避免点击不可信链接，并在 Mac OS X 中限制 Safari 浏览器对不可信 URL 的自动解析行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011//Oct/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011//Oct/msg00003.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2011/Nov/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Feb/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4999","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5002","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5052","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5130","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50085","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/50115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/70551","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2011/3xxx/CVE-2011-3246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-3246","https://github.com/BrokenPorkMachine/B34ST/blob/f4b5602a1ba3cb1d1cc6f89afe06462855e57582/exploits/kernel/CVE-2011-3246.c","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2011/CVE